## Technical Details

- **Backend Controller**: [`CertificateController.php`](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Certificates/app/Http/Controllers/CertificateController.php)
- **Feature Tests**: [`CertificateTest.php`](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Certificates/tests/Feature/CertificateTest.php)
- **Primary Routes**:
  - `POST /api/tenant/branding`: Updates tenant branding.
  - `POST /api/certificates/issue`: Validates and issues certificates.
  - `GET /api/certificates/{id}/download`: Generates and streams PDF.

